OL,3,GNEWSA'Major smell of gas' reported
OL,4,Abefore explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of 10 residents killed in a gas
OL,7,Fexplosion at a block of flats phoned
OL,8,Femergency services in the hours before
OL,9,Fthe blast to report a "major smell of
OL,10,Fgas," a court has heard.
OL,12,FA health and safety case against gas
OL,13,Fcompany Island Energy (IE), represented
OL,14,Fby chief executive Graeme Millar, is
OL,15,Fbeing heard over the deaths of 10
OL,16,Fresidents at the Haut du Mont flats in
OL,17,FSt Helier, Jersey, following the blast
OL,18,Fon 10 December 2022. The company has
OL,19,Fpleaded not guilty to offences.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
