OL,3,GNEWSA'Major smell of gas' reported
OL,4,Abefore explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FGas workers Lee Ward, 59, Neil
OL,7,FArmstrong, 58, and John Wright, 60,
OL,8,Feach deny 10 counts of gross negligence
OL,9,Fmanslaughter.
OL,11,FA recording of the 999 call made by
OL,12,FLouisa De Almeida, 64, who lived at 28
OL,13,FHaut du Mont, was played in court, in
OL,14,Fwhich she said she smelled gas in her
OL,15,Fhome despite her not being a gas
OL,16,Fconsumer.
